title: Renaissance Round D — Inbox/agent face, live agents, GitHub strip, detail panel (Tasks first cut complete)
summary: 'Completed the Tasks section''s first cut. Built the Inbox tab (the agent face: claimant pill-row driven by a new /api/tasks/whoami, single-claimant focused column with rolled-up calibration, NEXT-ACTIONABLE hero, dependsOn ribbon, inbox-zero states), live agent-effect wiring (cards register by derived symbols + useTaskAgentEffect → highlight/annotate land on cards), a GitHubSyncStrip footer (affordance-only Pull copies the CLI command — read router never mutates), and a right-slide TaskDetailPanel on card click. Tasks routes declared read-only in portal.yaml matching existing platform routes. Caught a transient inbox=0 during verification that didn''t reproduce (race with a prior serve process release; unit tests + 3 live queries confirm the correct active-filter behavior). Build green, CLI 441.'
